  "mechanism": "sys_preadv2 and sys_pwritev2 accept RWF_DSYNC, RWF_HIPRI, RWF_SYNC and RWF_NOWAIT, but do_sys_preadv and do_sys_pwritev bind them to an unused _flags parameter and the offset -1 path drops them entirely.",
